cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the upstream AeroVLA, OpenVLA and TravelUAV work when using UAV-VLA-Lab."
type: software
title: "UAV-VLA-Lab: Reproducible UAV Policy Experiments in Simulation"
authors:
  - name: "UAV-VLA-Lab contributors"
version: 0.1.0rc1
repository-code: "https://github.com/laxman-kc/UAV-VLA-Lab"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A research toolkit connecting AeroVLA policy execution, TravelUAV simulation,
  reviewed published-demonstration adaptation, paired evaluation, and inspectable
  experiment evidence. The initial study is a small single-map simulation pilot
  with mixed outcomes. This citation identifies software, not a peer-reviewed paper.
keywords:
  - UAV
  - vision-language-action
  - reproducibility
  - simulation
  - robot learning
